<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a typical slaughter steer for today was estimated at $9.63 per cwt live, down -0.03 when compared to  Wednesday's value.-USDA</p>
